      {
        "number": 12,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "12",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "12",
          "To consider 1. For is used to emphasize the whole period of the action; from beginning until present time. 2. Since emphasizes the beginning of the action. 3. Used indefinite time expressions for function two. 4. Present perfect progressive is mainly used when we want to express function 3 and 4."
        ],
